(14392, 0, 0, 'People of the Horde, citizens of Orgrimmar, come, gather round and celebrate a hero of the Horde. On this day, $n, under the auspices of our glorious Warchief, laid a mortal blow against the Black Dragonflight. The brood mother, Onyxia, has been slain!', 14, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9491, 2, 'VMaNGOS'),
