(16115, 3, 0, 'Scourge activity in the Plaguelands has increased ten-fold. We are receiving reports of Scourge attacks from as far away as Kalimdor! Now how do you suppose this has happened? How have the wretched undead done that which was previously thought impossible? Is nowhere safe?', 12, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 12051, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
