(16115, 5, 0, 'You lack tact, Commander. This is not surprising. However, you are right in that the Horde will be forced to act. But not just the Horde. They already come - heroes from across the world.', 12, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 12055, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
