(4509, 6, 0, 'In the throes of the Sundering, Ameth''Aran was at the whim of the terror that gripped the land. There was little hope for survival.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1471, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(4509, 7, 0, 'Athrikus came to us. He told us that he could save us from harm. He cast a spell upon us to protect us from harm.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1472, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(4509, 8, 0, 'When the shaking stopped, his true motives were revealed. We were trapped, and he was slowly draining our powers.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1474, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
