(212, 0, 0, 'I''ll crush you!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1925, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(212, 0, 1, 'Me smash! You die!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1926, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(212, 0, 2, 'Raaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaar!!! Me smash $R!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1927, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(233, 0, 0, 'Now how am I supposed to get those mechanical wretches out of my fields?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 58, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(233, 0, 1, 'A bunch of thugs and thieves aren''t going to get me to leave my land!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 59, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(233, 0, 2, 'They might have run all the other farmers off, but the Saldean''s will never leave Westfall.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 60, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(234, 0, 0, 'All hail, $n! Defender of The People!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 197, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(234, 0, 1, 'The People of Westfall salute $n, a brave and valiant defender of freedom.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 198, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(234, 0, 2, 'Three cheers for $n!  This land shall be ours once again!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 199, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(234, 1, 0, 'Everywhere I look I see thieves.  We, The People''s Miltia, must return this land to the farmers.', 12, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 39, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(234, 1, 1, 'The farms must be liberated.  Stormwind may have deserted these people, but I''ll be damned if I will.', 12, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 40, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(237, 0, 0, 'Can''t believe the forsaken wagon broke down.  Ain''t no luck to be had in this land. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 56, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(237, 0, 1, 'We''ll be out of here just as soon as I get this wagon fixed. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 57, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(238, 0, 0, 'Don''t worry, Old Blanchy, we''ll get you something to eat soon. . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 54, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(238, 0, 1, 'I never thought the day would come that I''d leave my homeland of Westfall. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 55, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(257, 0, 0, 'You no take candle!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1868, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(257, 0, 1, 'Yiieeeee! Me run!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1864, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(263, 0, 0, 'Undead are crawling all over the land.  Where is the Stormwind Army?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 63, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(264, 0, 0, 'Stay on the roads.  The forest is overrun with undead.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 61, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(264, 0, 1, 'Fear not.  The Night Watch will rid the land of this foul taint soon enough.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 62, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(265, 0, 0, 'I sense evil brewing. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 73, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(265, 0, 1, 'The stars speak to me.  They whisper of the horrors waiting in the night.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 74, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(265, 0, 2, 'The future holds much death and uncertainty, not unlike the past.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 75, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(265, 0, 3, 'The spirits whisper in my ear.  They are restless and full of angst.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 76, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(269, 0, 0, 'Constant bickering will get us nowhere.  We need to take action.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(269, 0, 1, 'The people of Darkshire expect more from the Council.  We cannot let them suffer from this unholy wrath which plagues us.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 69, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(269, 0, 2, 'The Council of Duskwood must take action.  Evil lingers in the air.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 68, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(270, 0, 0, 'We need better representation from Stormwind.  Our homes are falling to the undead.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 67, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(271, 0, 0, 'The news from Stormwind does not bode well. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 71, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(271, 0, 1, 'Our cause falls on deaf ears beyond the thick, stone walls of Stormwind.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 72, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(273, 0, 0, 'This dark taint is downright bad for business.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 82, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(274, 0, 0, 'Psssst.  We just got some Moonshine in. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 80, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(274, 0, 1, 'Step right up and wet your whistle.', 12, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 81, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(276, 0, 0, 'The stars will be in perfect form tonight!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 77, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(276, 0, 1, 'There is something greater than magic at work in the night sky.  One day they''ll listen to me. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 79, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(295, 0, 0, 'If your glass is full may it be again!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 84, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(295, 0, 1, 'Welcome to the Lion''s Pride Inn.  Make yourself at home!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 85, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(295, 0, 2, 'So much to do, so much to do!  Where does the time go?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 86, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(315, 0, 0, 'Who dares disturb me?  Die $n!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 508, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(315, 0, 1, 'I shall spill your blood, $C!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 509, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(325, 0, 0, 'Why haven''t the Stormwind guards come?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 964, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(325, 0, 1, 'The light appears to have forsaken us.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 966, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(325, 0, 2, 'I fear something dark is coming.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 965, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(327, 0, 0, 'You no take candle!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1868, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(327, 0, 1, 'Yiieeeee! Me run!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1864, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(332, 0, 0, 'You''re pushing it, $n.', 12, 7, 0, 25, 0, 0, 1402, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(332, 0, 1, 'Don''t make me go medieval on you.', 12, 7, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1403, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(332, 0, 2, 'Keep it up, $n, and I''ll beat some manners into you.', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 1404, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(332, 1, 0, '%s is not impressed.', 12, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 1401, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(346, 0, 0, 'Pull up a stool and have a drink!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 47, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(346, 0, 1, 'The bottles are dusty but the liquor goes down clean!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 48, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(348, 0, 0, 'Nothing biting. . . .', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 45, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(348, 0, 1, 'Here fishy fishy. . . come to papa.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 46, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(349, 0, 0, '$n, my wounds are grave.  Forgive my slow pace but my injuries won''t allow me to walk any faster.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 25, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(349, 1, 0, 'Ah, fresh air at last! I need a moment to rest, $N.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 26, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(349, 2, 0, 'The Blackrock infestation is thick in these parts.  I will do my best to keep the pace, $N.  Let''s go!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 27, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
