(1364, 0, 0, 'This land belongs to the Dark Iron Dwarves.  Prepare to see the afterlife, $C!', 12, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 455, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 0, 0, 'Think there are any fish in here?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 131, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 0, 1, 'I caught a big one last week, it had three eyes!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 132, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 0, 2, 'My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 133, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 0, 3, 'My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 134, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 1, 0, 'Look! Look! I caught something! Aww....it''s just a stinky ol'' boot.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 135, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 1, 1, 'I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 139, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 1, 2, 'And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 140, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1367, 1, 3, 'I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 141, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 0, 0, 'Hey guys, let''s try on the other side.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1090, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 1, 0, 'Really?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 147, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
