(1368, 5, 0, 'And that''s how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 149, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 5, 1, 'And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 150, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 5, 2, 'They say he can turn into a raven sometimes.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 151, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 5, 3, 'You know why orc eyes glow red? It''s because they drink blood!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 152, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 6, 0, 'There is no spoon.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 153, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 6, 1, 'I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 154, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 6, 2, 'And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 155, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1368, 6, 3, 'You know there are crocilisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 156, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 10, 0, 'Ah yes. I''ve heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 233, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 11, 0, 'Bah! By the time you got in range of old Trollplow you would be in reduced to rubble!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 235, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 12, 0, 'Hey Fizzer, I ever tell you the time I was riding through the canals and some goblins in shredder suits tried to ambush me?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 237, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 13, 0, 'Brahaha! Tha look on their faces as old Trollplow''s gun came swiveling around to meet them! Their saws couldn''t even touch me!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 239, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 14, 0, 'Bah! That''s no fun!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 241, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 15, 0, 'Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 244, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 16, 0, 'Har! You scared I''ll hurt your little dainty racer?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 246, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 17, 0, 'Haha! Sturdy old Trollplow has just a few meager battle scars!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 248, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 18, 0, 'Ha! I''d take the sound of a Crater Cannon XT blasting off a shell over that any day!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 250, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1377, 19, 0, 'Maybe, but if it did hit me upside the head I''d know exactly which cannon to use to blow it into the smallest bits!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 252, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1387, 0, 0, 'Guards!', 12, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 4561, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1393, 0, 0, 'Crush!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1913, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1393, 0, 1, 'Kill!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1914, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1393, 0, 2, 'Destroy!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1915, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1393, 1, 0, '%s becomes enraged!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7798, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1395, 0, 0, 'I will gladly pay you Tuesday for a hamburger today.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 182, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1395, 0, 1, 'Spare some change for a poor blind man? ...What do you mean I''m not blind? ...I''M NOT BLIND! I CAN SEE!! It''s a miracle!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 184, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1395, 0, 2, 'It''s all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 186, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1395, 1, 0, 'Shine yer armor for a copper.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 185, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1395, 1, 1, 'Help a poor bloke out?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 183, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1395, 1, 2, 'Could ye spare some coin?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 179, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
