(1405, 2, 1, 'I will gladly pay you Tuesday for a hamburger today.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 182, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1405, 2, 2, 'It''s all their fault, stupid Alliance army. Just had to build their towers right behind my farm.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 186, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 0, 0, 'If we reverse the Essence flows perhaps we can alter the polarity.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 201, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 0, 1, 'So then the array of magics would cascade into a chain reaction of positively charged energies.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 203, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 0, 2, 'The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 204, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 0, 3, 'When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don''t negate one another.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 205, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 1, 0, 'Wow, all of this for a love potion. Hope he''s worth it.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 222, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 1, 1, 'If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y''serian approach.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 223, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 1, 2, 'At least we wouldn''t be around to have to clean it up.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 224, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1413, 1, 3, 'Only if we didn''t follow the proper initialization procedures.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 225, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1423, 0, 0, 'Hello again, Antonio. Thank you again for the hat for my wife. She adored it.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 718, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1426, 0, 0, 'More bones to gnaw on...', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1871, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1426, 0, 1, 'Grrrr... fresh meat!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1870, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 0, 0, 'Scourge spotted nearby!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12366, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 0, 1, 'I just saw a Scourge!  Kill it!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12367, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 0, 2, 'Did you see that?  There''s a Scourge over there!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12368, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 0, 3, 'How can I get anything done with the Scourge running amok around here?!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12369, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 1, 0, 'There''s one of the Scourge, right over there!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12370, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 1, 1, 'This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Stormwind!  Destroy it before more come!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12371, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 1, 2, 'Will these unrelenting Scourge attacks never end?', 12, 7, 0, 6, 0, 0, 12372, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1432, 1, 3, 'Destroy the Scourge invader now, before it''s too late!', 12, 7, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12373, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1446, 0, 0, '...Nine...Ten...Ready or not.  Here I come!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 279, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1446, 1, 0, 'Hey! You better not have gone too far!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 280, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1446, 2, 0, 'Mom said not to climb up there any more.  I''m gonna tell!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 281, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1446, 3, 0, 'Mom, Jesse climbed the wind tower again.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 302, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 0, 0, 'Hey Reese, give me an'' Christoph another round.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 431, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 1, 0, 'Remember when Danath gathered all the mercenaries of Stormwind together and we marched to fight at Nethergarde?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 399, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 1, 1, 'I tell ye, I don''t miss the Great War at all. I remember when we fought at Darrowmere. All night in the fog, lying in a muddy trench.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 400, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 1, 2, 'I miss the dwarven ale we used to get at that inn in Lordaeron. Remember that fight we started there?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 401, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 1, 3, 'Less than a hundred of us, and over a thousand orcs. Only a handful of us managed to walk away from that one.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 402, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 2, 0, 'The best had to have been the look on Perenolde''s face when our army comes marchin'' right up to his front door. What a battle!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 403, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 2, 1, 'Battling that band of Twilight Hammer in the Morass, I could think of better places for a war.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 405, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 2, 2, 'Ahh yes, now I remember, your wedding night wasn''t it?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 406, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 2, 3, 'Ahh the Glustewelt twins!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 407, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 3, 0, 'I still have the scars from that night.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 408, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 3, 1, 'Broke both me legs that night. How could I forget?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 409, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 3, 2, 'I woke up in a bed in Northshire three weeks later. Don''t remember a damn thing.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 410, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 3, 3, 'Wasn''t that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 411, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 4, 0, 'I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 413, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 4, 1, 'Course I remember that night. Two inches to the left and you''d be drinking with that elf, Morris. That was my best shirt, too.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 414, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 4, 2, 'Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 415, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 4, 3, 'Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 416, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 5, 0, 'Hehe, wimp.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 417, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 5, 1, 'You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 418, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 5, 2, 'It all worked out in the end.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 419, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 5, 3, 'Let''s not even begin comparing battle scars, my friend.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 420, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 6, 0, 'Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 421, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 6, 1, 'You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 422, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 6, 2, 'Well, you''re still here. I''d say that is something worth drinking to.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 423, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1478, 6, 3, 'You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 424, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 0, 0, 'I HAVE YOUR LITTLE BELT TIED AROUND MY FINGER, SMOTTS.  DON''T YOU WANT IT BACK?', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 776, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 0, 1, 'SMOTTS!  HEY, SMOTTS!!  COME OUT AND PLAY!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 764, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 0, 2, 'DON''T LET THIS STATUE BE MY ONLY COMPANY.  COME OUT AND PLAY!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 778, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 1, 0, 'COME OUT TO JANEIRO''S POINT.  I''M WAITING FOR YOU, SMOTTS...', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 775, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 1, 1, 'I PROMISE I WON''T KILL YOUR CREW THIS TIME.  HAH!  BUT MY BROTHER MIGHT EAT THEM!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 774, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 1, 2, 'SMOTTS, I HAVE YOUR LITTLE BELT...COME GET IT.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 773, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 2, 0, 'HAVE YOU RUN OUT OF SHIPS TO SEND?  WHERE''S YOUR COURAGE?', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 777, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 2, 1, 'YOU WERE SUCH GOOD SPORT THE LAST TIME...COME OUT!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 772, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1493, 2, 2, 'SMOTTS, I HAVE YOUR LITTLE BELT...COME GET IT.', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 773, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1506, 0, 0, 'You carry the taint of the Scourge.  Prepare to enter the Twisting Nether.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2625, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1506, 0, 1, 'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge''s taint.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2626, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1506, 0, 2, 'The Light condemns all who harbor evil.  Now you will die!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2627, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(1506, 1, 0, 'There is no escape for you.  The Crusade shall destroy all who carry the Scourge''s taint.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2626, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
