(5661, 8, 0, 'Lysta, summon in the captives.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1977, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5661, 9, 0, 'Not a challenge at all it seems. Let us see how you handle your second test. Lysta, bring forth the minions of the Lich King.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1980, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5661, 10, 0, 'Lysta, summon in undead captives.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 8306, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5661, 11, 0, 'It is time to face your final challenge young warriors! Prepare for your hardest fight yet.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1984, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5661, 12, 0, 'Lysta, summon forth... the abomination!', 12, 33, 0, 5, 0, 0, 8307, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5661, 13, 0, 'Well done Edward and Tyler. You are progressing along in your training quite nicely. We shall test your mettle again soon.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1985, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 4, 0, 'Theresa, take this to Father Lankester.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1995, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 5, 0, 'As good as I told you it would be, yes?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2003, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 5, 1, 'Didn''t I tell you my new domination techniques would work?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2002, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 5, 2, 'So what do you think of my new toy?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1994, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 5, 3, 'How do you like my pet?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 6, 0, 'I''ve never seen anything like it. No concentration or loss of awareness while the subject is dominated. What did you do to her?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2017, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 6, 1, 'Amazing! How did you manage a permanent dominate?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2013, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 6, 2, 'I don''t approve of your experiments, Gerard, but I must admit the results are impressive. What exactly did you do to her?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2014, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 7, 0, 'She retains knowledge and speech, and even the self sufficiency to perform tasks for you. Precisely what did you do?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2016, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 7, 1, 'Truly amazing, Gerard. How did you do it?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2012, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 8, 0, 'A little torture, a pinch of magic, and an ample helping of invasive surgery. She was conscious, of course.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2007, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 8, 1, 'Everyone has a weakness, it''s just a matter of finding it.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2008, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 8, 2, 'It was simple once I broke her spirit.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2004, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 9, 0, 'I managed to discover that certain parts of the brain when removed or stimulated will make a subject much more docile. ', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2009, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 9, 1, 'You don''t expect me to give up all my secrets do you?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2005, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 9, 2, 'A little ritual torture can go a long way.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2006, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 10, 0, 'Bravo, Gerard, you have exceeded yourself, yet again.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2018, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 10, 1, 'I am truly impressed, Gerard. I thought you were all talk, but I see I have been proven wrong.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2019, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 10, 2, 'I don''t agree with your turning to alchemy to fix some of the problems, but I do agree with the results. Very well done.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2024, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 11, 0, 'Did you have to house train her, Gerard?', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2027, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 11, 1, 'An amazing discovery you have made. I would love an opportunity to look at all of the failed experiments.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2023, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 0, 0, 'If I could just find "Magic and the Ways of Power". Ahh here it is, what was it doing over here?', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2034, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 0, 1, 'Very interesting. But if that''s the case then my theory is wrong. I must reread the other sections to see what I missed.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2040, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 0, 2, '"Magical Flows and How They Effect the World", by Maginor Dumas. That''s the one I was looking for.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2030, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 0, 3, 'If this is correct then I have a lot more research to do.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2042, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 1, 0, 'Ahh there it is.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2029, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 1, 1, 'I really need a better system for filing these books. Ahh that''s the one I wanted.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2031, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 1, 2, 'But this can''t be right. Where did I put that other book?', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2043, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 1, 3, '"Khadgar''s Mystical Journal, Volume 8." I think this is the one I wanted.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2032, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 2, 0, 'Ahh, "Mystical Conjurings of the Archmages of Dalaran." Perfect.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2033, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 2, 1, 'If I could just find "Magic and the Ways of Power". Ahh here it is, what was it doing over here?', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2034, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 2, 2, '"Magic Maladies", no. "Magic Matricies", no. Ahh here we go "Magic Mysteries".', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2035, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 2, 3, 'There''s the mystical tome I was looking for.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2036, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 3, 0, 'Yes, yes. Hmm, it seems to cross reference another tome. Guess I have to find that one too.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2037, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 3, 1, 'That wasn''t very helpful. Let me check the other one.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2038, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 3, 2, 'That''s what I wanted to know. Now I just need to find where the flux variance is discussed.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2039, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 3, 3, 'So I was right about the energies. Let''s see what the other tome has to say on the subject.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2041, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5700, 4, 0, 'Back to the drawing board.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2044, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 12, 0, 'If you''re here, then it means you are prepared to begin the study of summoning demonic cohorts to do your bidding. We will start with the lowliest creatures you will be able to call and continue from there. Let us begin.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2049, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 13, 0, 'The easiest creature for you to summon is the imp. You should already be able to bring forth this minion but for completeness'' sake I will start with him.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2050, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 14, 0, 'This foul little beast is the imp. It is small and weak, making it almost useless as a meatshield, and its damage output is mediocre at best. This creature is best used for support of a larger group.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2051, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 15, 0, 'Now that you have had a chance to study the imp, let us move on to the next minion you will be able to summon, the voidwalker.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2052, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 16, 0, 'This demonic entity is known as the Voidwalker. Its strength and endurance are significant, making it ideal for defense. Send it to attack your enemy, then use it as a shield while you use your spells and abilities to drain away your opponent''s life.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2053, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 17, 0, 'If you''ve never seen one, it is a sight to behold. A very impressive creature both on and off the field of battle. Next, let us take a look at what I am sure all you male students have been waiting for. The succubus.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2054, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 18, 0, 'All right now. Aside from the obvious distractions a minion like this will provide against your more masculine foes, she is also capable of dealing out impressive amounts of damage. However, her fragile endurance makes her almost useless as a shield.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2055, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 19, 0, 'Study hard and you might one day be able to summon one on your own, but for now it''s time to move on to the felhunter.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2056, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 20, 0, 'What you see before you is a felhunter. This creature''s natural talents include spell lock and other abilities which make it unequalled when facing a magically attuned opponent.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2057, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 21, 0, 'When facing a spellcaster of any kind, this feral beast will be your best friend. Now, let us take a look at something a bit different. This next creature will aid your travels and make your future journeys much easier. Let''s take a look at a felsteed.', 12, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2058, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5702, 22, 0, 'I doubt you have had much occasion to see such a creature. These demonic equines will make your travels much faster by acting as your mount as long as you control them. However, they are difficult to control, so be sure you are ready before attempting it.
