(4620, 2, 0, 'And it''s the $n coming through turn one!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1517, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(4922, 0, 0, 'For the Blue!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1777, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(4923, 0, 0, 'For the Red!', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1778, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5095, 0, 0, 'Jarad, you are up first for us.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1775, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5096, 0, 0, 'Edward, ya leadin'' us off. Git in there.', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1776, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(4980, 3, 0, 'Must be your lucky day. Alright, I''ll talk. Just leave me alone. Look, you''re not going to believe me, but it wa... oh, Light, looks like the girl could shoot...', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1725, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5608, 0, 0, 'I dunno. What do you want to do?', 12, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1923, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(5696, 12, 0, 'Why thank you, my pet.', 12, 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, 2011, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(10424, 5, 0, 'The Scourge have broken through in all wings!  May the light defeat these foul creatures!  We shall fight to the last!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6439, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(12480, 0, 0, '$n, eh? Oy! Citizen $n, come ''ere. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon has requested that all able bodied heroes o'' the Alliance meet with him at Stormwind Keep. You just been recruited, mate! Get a move on!', 12, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7901, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 18, 0, 'Curious. A Servitor of Rastakhan that does not know the Hakkari do not converse in the old tongue?', 12, 14, 0, 6, 0, 0, 10310, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 19, 0, 'You are a fool, soon to forfeit his life. No?', 12, 14, 0, 6, 0, 0, 10313, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 20, 0, '%s laughs.', 16, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 10315, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 21, 0, 'How pathetic. I am infused with the power of the Soulflayer. I fear nothing but the wrath of the almighty Hakkar. I serve no one but my master, Jin.', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10316, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 22, 0, '%s laughs.', 16, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 10315, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 23, 0, 'Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10318, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 24, 0, 'Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin...', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10319, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 25, 0, '%s laughs maniacally.', 16, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 10321, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 26, 0, 'FOOL! Do you purport to have even one-tenth of the power you held during the Uprising? The nations were united and still were nearly consumed by a shadow of Hakkar. You stand no chance.', 12, 14, 0, 25, 0, 0, 10322, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 27, 0, 'And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised.', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10323, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 28, 0, 'Bloodscalp, Sandfury, Skullsplitter, Vilebranch and Witherbark. They all pledge their allegiance to Jin - their souls to Hakkar. You have lost.', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10324, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 29, 0, '%s laughs.', 16, 0, 0, 11, 0, 0, 10315, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 30, 0, 'The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?', 12, 14, 0, 6, 0, 0, 10326, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 31, 0, 'It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol''jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul''jin missing, probably dead.', 12, 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 10327, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 32, 0, '%s smirks.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10329, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 33, 0, 'And... do you expect to defeat the Primal Gods?', 12, 14, 0, 6, 0, 0, 10328, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 34, 0, 'Is it? Call out to them, Servitor.', 12, 14, 0, 6, 0, 0, 10331, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 35, 0, 'Where are your Gods now? WHERE, SERVITOR?', 12, 14, 0, 11, 0, 0, 10333, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 36, 0, 'Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful...', 12, 14, 0, 5, 0, 0, 10334, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14912, 37, 0, '%s drops his shoulders and exposes his neck.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10335, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14911, 3, 0, '%s spits on the corpse of the fallen zealot.', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10336, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14911, 4, 0, 'Right away, Servitor.', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10307, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(14911, 5, 0, 'Move!', 12, 14, 0, 1, 0, 0, 10308, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16113, 0, 0, 'Thank you, Mrs. Chambers.', 12, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 12140, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16113, 0, 1, 'Is this a mango? Stupendous!', 12, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 12141, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16113, 0, 2, 'You''ve really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!', 12, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 12142, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16114, 0, 0, 'Your message did reach us, Commander, but by no means is our involvement here sanctioned by the Grand Crusader.', 12, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 12047, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16114, 1, 0, 'The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men...', 12, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 12052, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16114, 2, 0, 'Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth...', 12, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, 12054, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
(16114, 3, 0, 'Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best.', 12, 0, 0, 274, 0, 0, 12056, 0, 'VMaNGOS'),
